    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83610" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλατυσ-μός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>widening, enlarging, dilatation,
				distension,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξήνεγκέ με εἰς
			πλατυσμόν</span> into <i>broad space,</i> into <i>open
				ground,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ki.</u>
				22.20
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν πλατυσμῷ</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Si.</u>
				47.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>boasting, bragging,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πουλυμαθημοσύνης</span> Timo <i><span class="en">
				20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>amplitude,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ποιήσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					1382.21
				</span></i>
			.</div>
